OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%,.** %-,(,%,. (,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AMajor review to propose tax, welfare,
OL,4,Aand education changes to get young
OL,5,Apeople into work
OL,6,
OL,7,FTo do that, he's proposing changes to
OL,8,Fbenefits - including that under-25s
OL,9,Fshould no longer be able to claim the
OL,10,Fhealth element of Universal Credit,
OL,11,Falthough some people would still be
OL,12,Feligible for extra help
OL,14,FMilburn will also propose lower rates
OL,15,Fof National Insurance for employing
OL,16,Fyoung people, and more apprenticeships
OL,18,FHe says a "complete system reset" is
OL,19,Fneeded - but the Conservatives say his
OL,20,Freport is "too cautious" in parts and
OL,21,Ftoo reliant on the "expensive hand of
OL,22,Fthe state"
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
